# "{T}: Add {G} or {U}." The color is chosen as the ability is activated, one each turn (green, blue); the other colors and
# colorless are refused beside those positive controls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thornwood Falls
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Thornwood Falls.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Thornwood Falls.Activate(Color: White)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Thornwood Falls.Activate(Color: Black)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Thornwood Falls.Activate(Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Thornwood Falls.Activate(Color: Colorless)
